# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:12
translate italian english3_8b8bb224:

    # "The school-day goes by normally until my English class."
    "La giornata scolastica scorre normalmente fino alla mia lezione di inglese."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:13
translate italian english3_66510385:

    # "Mrs. McGee has us working on essays in class. Everyone is quiet, looking down at their papers."
    "La signora McGee ci fa lavorare sui saggi in classe. Tutti sono in silenzio, con lo sguardo rivolto sui propri fogli."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:14
translate italian english3_3d0d4f25:

    # "But I feel like somebody is watching me."
    "Ma mi sembra che qualcuno mi stia osservando."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:17
translate italian english3_0ba62eb9:

    # "I look up at see Mrs. McGee gazing at me. Staring. A slight smile on her face."
    "Alzo lo sguardo e vedo la signora McGee che mi fissa. Mi fissa intensamente. Ha un leggero sorriso sul viso."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:18
translate italian english3_e3525f66:

    # "I wonder what she could be thinking about?"
    "Mi chiedo a cosa possa stare pensando?"

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:21
translate italian english3_2d0786b4:

    # "She smiles, moving her hand close to her mouth."
    "Sorride, avvicinando la mano alla bocca."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:22
translate italian english3_8c67e0d6:

    # "I look around at the other students surrounding me, but their eyes are all focused on the essays they are writing."
    "Mi guardo intorno verso gli altri studenti che mi circondano, ma i loro occhi sono tutti concentrati sui temi che stanno scrivendo."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:23
translate italian english3_342debb3:

    # "There is no doubt that Mrs. McGee's gaze is meant for me and me alone."
    "Non c’è dubbio che lo sguardo della signora McGee sia rivolto a me e solo a me."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:26
translate italian english3_48f33b68:

    # "While I am looking directly at her, she slips the tip of her index finger between her plump lips, sucking it sensually."
    "Mentre la guardo dritto negli occhi, lei fa scivolare la punta dell’indice tra le sue labbra carnose, succhiandola sensualmente."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:27
translate italian english3_3972cbcf:

    # "Her eyes never leave mine."
    "I suoi occhi non si staccano mai dai miei."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:28
translate italian english3_1596ea41:

    # "There is little doubt what she is thinking now. My cock twitches in my pants, thumping against the thin fabric."
    "Non c’è dubbio su cosa stia pensando in questo momento. Il mio cazzo si contrae nei pantaloni, battendo contro il tessuto sottile."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:29
translate italian english3_341dee20:

    # "Then Randy, the know-it-all asshole who always has something clever to say, speaks up and breaks our trance."
    "Poi Randy, quel coglione saputello che ha sempre qualcosa di arguto da dire, interviene e rompe la nostra trance."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:32
translate italian english3_52d7af01:

    # "Randy" "Mrs. McGee, my essay is done, can I leave?"
    "Randy" "«Signora McGee, ho finito il mio tema, posso andarmene?»"

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:33
translate italian english3_937ce766:

    # "Mrs. McGee quickly looks up and straightens herself, as if she hasn't been thinking about dick for the last few minutes."
    "La signora McGee alza rapidamente lo sguardo e si ricompone, come se negli ultimi minuti non avesse pensato a un cazzo."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:34
translate italian english3_82e82c18:

    # et "Yes Randy, you can leave."
    et "«Sì, Randy, puoi andartene.»"

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:35
translate italian english3_90bacfb8:

    # et "In fact, any of you who are done with your essays, or would prefer to work on them at home, feel free to leave any time."
    et "«Anzi, chiunque di voi abbia finito il tema, o preferisca lavorarci a casa, è libero di andarsene in qualsiasi momento.»"

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:36
translate italian english3_69be14c8:

    # "Most of the class stands up then and leaves, but I stay. So do Juliana and a few other people."
    "La maggior parte della classe si alza e se ne va, ma io resto. Lo stesso fanno Juliana e qualche altra persona."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:37
translate italian english3_dd5bdbb5:

    # "I don't really have anywhere to go before the next class anyways."
    "Tanto non ho davvero nessun posto dove andare prima della prossima lezione."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:39
translate italian english3_44bea0f3:

    # "So I focus on getting my essay done, occasionally looking up at Mrs. McGee."
    "Quindi mi concentro sul finire il mio saggio, alzando lo sguardo di tanto in tanto verso la signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:40
translate italian english3_9fb697a3:

    # "She is focused on her work now, her eyes down on the desk in front of her."
    "Ora è concentrata sul suo lavoro, con gli occhi fissi sul banco davanti a lei."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:41
translate italian english3_166c1158:

    # "At the end of class, I stand up and get ready to leave."
    "Alla fine della lezione, mi alzo e mi preparo ad andarmene."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:44
translate italian english3_6f3f8621:

    # et "I appreciate you staying until the end of class."
    et "Apprezzo che tu sia rimasto fino alla fine della lezione."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:45
translate italian english3_314047f4:

    # et "I know it wasn't the most exciting class today, but it's good that you're committed to learning."
    et "So che oggi la lezione non è stata delle più entusiasmanti, ma è bello che tu sia così impegnato nell’apprendimento."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:49
translate italian english3_3c2d53ef:

    # et "I'm glad. I hope we can continue sometime."
    et "Ne sono felice. Spero che potremo continuare qualche altra volta."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:52
translate italian english3_b244bcae:

    # et "Don't get in too much of a hurry."
    et "Non avere troppa fretta."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:53
translate italian english3_398957e6:

    # et "Besides, my next class is coming in right now."
    et "Inoltre, la mia prossima classe sta entrando proprio ora."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:58
translate italian english3_db48971e:

    # et "Well, okay then."
    et "Beh, va bene allora."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:59
translate italian english3_c08bcb72:

    # et "I'll see you next time, [pcname]."
    et "Ci vediamo la prossima volta, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:60
translate italian english3_9259ab8b:

    # et "You have a good day."
    et "Buona giornata."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:61
translate italian english3_66796d27:

    # pc "You too, Mrs. McGee."
    pc "Anche a te, signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:64
translate italian english3_d25b195e:

    # "I leave her class and go on to my next."
    "Esco dalla sua classe e vado alla prossima."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:65
translate italian english3_764b5703:

    # "I can't get her out of my head though. She had definitely been coming on to me."
    "Non riesco però a togliermela dalla testa. Mi stava decisamente facendo delle avance."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:66
translate italian english3_40a773cc:

