# game/Scenes/School/English/english3.rpy:77
translate italian english3_cf1b04ad:

    # "The rest of the day passes by uneventfully. Then I leave and go to work."
    "Il resto della giornata trascorre senza particolari eventi. Poi me ne vado e vado al lavoro."

